# Rocci Project

Rocci is an open experiment to bring functional ergonomics and typed purity to web-native applications and technical documentation.

## Sections

- [Project status](/project/status/) — Current implementation status, working subsystems, and deliberate boundaries.
- [Roadmap](/project/roadmap/) — Planned capabilities, collections, search, and cross-platform releases.
- [Contributing](/project/contributing/) — Development setup, testing guidelines, and repository conventions.
- [Documentation](/docs/) — Technical guides, architecture concepts, and API reference. The product manual stays here.
- Knowledge — Working memory for the committed knowledge bundle (header lane), not a second product manual.
